{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017HymKTFMfDv4PE7eQeGhCB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 diff_collision_sdf 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (72 个)\\n\\n- **baseline_lora_spatial_bowl_s0**: DONE (success) — \\n- **eval_a3_v10a_refine**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **eval_a3_object_pudding_no_refine**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **eval_a3_object_pudding_refine**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **a3_gradient_object_pudding_s0**: DONE (success) — \\n- **baseline_spatial_bowl_s0_v2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **baseline_object_pudding_s0_v2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v3**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **baseline_spatial_bowl_s1_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **baseline_spatial_bowl_s0**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **baseline_spatial_bowl_s1**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **baseline_object_pudding_s0**: DONE (failed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-25\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| train_pi05_phase2_lambda0_s2 | Phase 2 λ=0 ablation (seed2): resume from seed2 l005 best (10K step) checkpoint with SDF loss disabled (λ=0). Tests whether early SDF-encoded collision awareness persists in LoRA weights when SDF loss is removed, while task performance (TSR) recovers. 10K additional steps with LoRA unfrozen. | — | — | — |\\n| train_pi05_a1_spatial_bowl_s0_l005 | Pi0.5+A1 SDF auxiliary loss on spatial_bowl scene (λ=0.005, seed 0). Tests cross-scene generalization of collision avoidance training. spatial_bowl has bilateral obstacles requiring bidirectional avoidance, distinct from object_pudding's single-side constraints. | — | — | — |\\n| train_pi05_lora_baseline_s1 | Pi0.5 LoRA baseline (no SDF) 30K on object_pudding seed 1: second seed for LoRA-only attribution baseline. Same setup as s0. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- eval_pi05_a1_best_s0_l005: Pi0.5+A1 best checkpoint eval (seed0, λ=0.005) using /best/ checkpoint. Completes 3-seed best-checkpoint coverage (s1 best=step16K, s2 best=step10K already done). s0 best=step26000. Tests whether best-loss checkpoint CAR/TSR matches s1/s2 pattern.（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **eval_pi05_a1_30k_s0_l01_disp** (success): Pi0.5+A1 30K displacement eval (seed0, λ=0.01): 用修复后的eval脚本重跑seed0 l01 30K checkpoint，获取含max_ee_displacement的完整eval结果。与10K best对比验证30K是否存在action collapse。 ← 基于 train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\\n- **eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_disp** (success): Displacement fix验证: 重跑s1_l005_30k eval，验证修复后的eval_safelibero.py正确输出max_ee_displacement字段，safe episodes中应有合理分布（不再恒<0.001） ← 基于 eval_pi05_a1_30k_s1_l005_v3\\n- **eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k** (success): Pi0.5+A1 best checkpoint eval (seed2, λ=0.005, step 10K): evaluates the sweet-spot checkpoint before action collapse. At 10K the model showed real collision avoidance (~0.4% filtered CAR). Compares with 30K (100% frozen) to demonstrate the collapse phenomenon quantitatively. ← 基于 train_pi05_a1_obj_s2_l005\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 30 / 负向 16 / 失败 8 / 共 67\\navg_CAR: 52.5 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\navg_TSR: 6.5 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-35807: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\nwestd-45947: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1\\n\\n## 告警\\n- baseline_spatial_bowl_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- baseline_spatial_bowl_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- baseline_object_pudding_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- baseline_spatial_bowl_s1_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- eval_a3_object_pudding_refine: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- eval_a3_object_pudding_no_refine: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- eval_a3_spatial_force_refine_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- eval_a3_spatial_m024fix_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- oracle_true_gt_object_v11: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- oracle_true_gt_feature_obje